" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><br></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Lead.FirstName} {!Lead.LastName},</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for registering your interest in the Qantas Distribution Platform. Prior to a Qantas representative reaching out to set a date and time for an introductory call, we kindly ask that you return a signed copy of the attached Mutual Confidentiality Agreement and complete a pre-qualification questionnaire via the link below:</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://bit.ly/2Gg9HU5" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://bit.ly/2Gg9HU5" target="_blank" alt="Questionnaire" title="Questionnaire" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Questionnaire</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://bit.ly/2Gg9HU5" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your answers to the questionnaire will allow us to better understand your specific business requirements and how we may be able to work together. We look forward to speaking with you.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>Warm regards,<br>The Qantas Distribution Platform Team</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 45px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
